{"id":"vod_bf_33833","vodId":"33833","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"天使的心跳","name_cn":"天使的心跳","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-35/d21dea87bc9152148436a0ea5d112d51.jpg"},"summary":"音无结弦（神谷浩史 配音）死后来到了死后的世界。醒来后发现在一座学校里，一名叫仲村由里（樱井浩美 配音）的女孩让他加入“无法容忍死掉战线”组织，简称SSS。他们的任务就是要和敌人——神的代表学生会长天使立华奏（花泽香菜 配音）作战。由里是这条战线的领袖，只要反抗天使就能继续存在，消灭天使就能获得世界。还没恢复记忆的音无只好答应加入她们的组织，但是他发现天使刀枪不入，他们都是不会受伤和死亡的。所谓敌人和战斗都是针对天使立华奏一个人的。音无还没恢复记忆，他不清楚这样的行为是不是正当的。真相慢慢被揭穿，年轻的生命们早早夭折，到底是神的恶意玩笑还是另有安排......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 09:35:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/tianshidexintiao/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:43:29.706Z"}